# Applies to the whole build context (the parent directory of this repo and
# dagda) when building with BuildKit, which looks for a dockerignore file
# named after the Dockerfile before falling back to a plain .dockerignore at
# the context root — keeps this scoped to MQTTToolbox2's own Dockerfile
# without needing a file outside this repo.
#
# CI checks out both repos fresh, so none of this ever exists there; this
# only matters for a local `docker build` run against an already-worked-in
# checkout.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.tsc-build
**/.git
**/*.log
# Never in git (see .gitignore) so CI never has it either — excluded here
# too, defensively, for a local build run against a real checkout: it must
# never end up baked into a build-stage layer.
**/.env
